 <p>You have successfully added the user_group gem to your application.
   The gem will allow you to easily manage users and groups, for the dri
   project, or possibly for other similar projects.</p>

 <p>This page lists the routes available to your application. Remember to
   prefix them with the user_groups namespace.</p>

